### 提示
### 先执行 `requests/auth.http` 里的登录请求，
### 然后把返回的 `access-token` 和 `refresh-token` 放到下面的变量里。
###
### 评论响应中 author 字段使用统一的 UserInfo 结构体。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:2333
@accessToken = your_access_token
@refreshToken = your_refresh_token

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 需要认证的接口
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### create root comment (top-level)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "env": {
    "ipv6": "test",
    "device_info": "test",
    "os": "Windows"
  },
  "post_id": 1,
  "content": "This is a root comment."
}

### create reply to root comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "env": {
    "ipv6": "test",
    "device_info": "test",
    "os": "Windows"
  },
  "post_id": 1,
  "root_comment_id": 1,
  "parent_comment_id": 1,
  "content": "This is a reply to the root comment."
}

### create nested reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "env": {
    "ipv6": "test",
    "device_info": "test",
    "os": "Windows"
  },
  "post_id": 1,
  "root_comment_id": 1,
  "parent_comment_id": 2,
  "content": "This is a nested reply."
}

### like a comment (toggle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment/like
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "comment_id": 1
}

### dislike a comment (toggle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comment/dislike
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

{
  "comment_id": 1
}

### delete comment (must be author)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comment/1
Cookie: access-token={{accessToken}}; refresh-token={{refreshToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 公开接口
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### list root comments for a post (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/post/1/comments?page=1&page_size=20

### list replies of a comment (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1/replies?page=1&page_size=20
